  "term": "anomie",
  "definition": "Anomie is a condition in which society becomes disorganized and people feel demoralized, often because there is a mismatch between shared cultural goals and the accepted ways of reaching them. It can show up in individual behavior such as nonconformity, social withdrawal, or other deviant actions.",
